--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party libraries in the Frontcache distributions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The server and console distributions bundle third-party libraries (Eclipse
Jetty, Apache Lucene, Ehcache, Apache HttpComponents, Resilience4j, Micrometer,
Jackson, Gson, Spring Framework, logback and others). Each is listed, with its
license and the license and notice files it ships, in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt at
the root of the distribution; the build refuses a distribution that bundles a
library offering none of Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause or EPL-2.0.
The server distribution also carries Eclipse Jetty's own notice and license in
server/notice.html and server/license-eplv10-aslv20.html.
